The input engines the phone and both PCs share, each under its project's licence:
- mozc/: SebType's Mozc (Mozc's engine and server with SebType's changes), under Mozc's licence
  (BSD-3-Clause, Google; each folder's LICENSE, and the licences of the data in src/data/).
- librime/: SebType's librime (librime with SebType's changes), under librime's licence (BSD-3-Clause,
  librime/LICENSE).
- sebtype-lm/: SebType's English model loader, SebType's own code under the MIT licence (LICENSE-SebType
  at the repository's root). It builds on llama.cpp (MIT), which it fetches and doesn't copy.
- latinime/: AOSP LatinIME's decoder, unchanged, under the Apache License 2.0 (latinime/NOTICE).
- sebtype-lm/english.gguf: SebType's English model (tools/english-lm, release r2), under the Creative
  Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 licence (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/), because
  part of its training text is share-alike. Its sources are credited in ../NOTICE and
  ../tools/english-lm/SOURCES.md.
